  "bodyHash": "2dfb62885dea2788",
  "content": "\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardcore-night-vision-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊此處獲取本模組的極限模式版本！</span></em></span></strong></a></h6>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-night-vision-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>基礎夜視鏡！</strong></em></span></a></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">無限夜視</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.20.1 </strong><strong>需要&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.1 需要 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adorned (Curios)</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_33cb7fe7-a45b-4ac1-a089-a25c3d62d41c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_02dd7518-5720-4fdf-b4c7-aaf7ca1f0abf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"161\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>最新更新！</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.2</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">夜視鏡可以放置在盔甲架上以及地面上</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_fade80a2-9975-4f9a-be63-12f867a180d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"229\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">右鍵點擊夜視鏡以設定特定旋轉角度</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">手持任意夜視鏡蹲下右鍵可開啟裝備選項</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_6b385b68-337c-4eba-b5b9-3e9443f928d1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"242\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_6e170233-0b98-4e78-a9b0-cda91641f24b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.1</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">為對應顏色的夜視鏡新增了色彩濾鏡覆蓋層</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">濾鏡為選填項目，可與夜視功能同時開啟或關閉</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_1630352c-3f9a-4324-9772-be3fa439909a.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\"><strong>版本 1.1.0</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\">&nbsp;新增多彩夜視鏡</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_e4b8e1ea-23f4-4a77-88af-32a7bab312cd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您無需重新製作即可更換夜視鏡顏色</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_034cfc64-9615-467b-9deb-017bc2a0ebc8.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">請查看下方的更新日誌以獲取更多詳細資訊</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">範例圖片</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8e9ea63b-ade5-422d-9655-04e24e461f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5743bfae-f9c3-40f0-9cae-3dfc421d4012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b6f467e2-1a8c-4bdf-bbb5-365bf4995506.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9174c0df-7e87-4753-92fb-cb576afca1f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_054206e1-4d9f-441b-8749-b61077ec536a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cbe58293-ae29-4409-b34e-ce3c862c9318.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c78c50c2-2095-48f3-b2ea-91620e1784cf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3b602255-e02b-4f46-9c6d-e0aef2aa5ffd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c34fa112-bc7f-494b-8f07-9bca56c0e418.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e022106-3f57-424c-adb7-fd33d5aa9295.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073439/description_5340add8-42b9-4b0d-98c9-684f043932a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"191\"></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">更新日誌</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>1.0.1</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 於遊戲內模組選單中新增模組描述&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 為 1.20.1 模組新增 NeoForge 標籤&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.0.2</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&bull; 修復蹲伏、游泳及飛行時夜視鏡佩戴位置不正確的問題</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.1.0</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 新增 7 種顏色</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增交換夜視鏡顏色的合成配方&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>1.1.1</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 修復動畫期間模型未跟隨玩家頭部旋轉的問題</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 修復模型不一致的問題&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 鼻樑挖空部分僅存在於 Java 版模型中</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 更改夜視鏡名稱顏色以匹配鏡片顏色&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增色彩覆蓋層&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 視覺濾鏡，模擬現實中夜視鏡的外觀效果</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 每款夜視鏡擁有專屬的色彩濾鏡，與其鏡片顏色相匹配&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增「Night Vision Goggles」按鍵綁定分類</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 將「Night Vision Goggles」按鍵綁定更名為「Night Vision」</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增色彩覆蓋層（濾鏡）的按鍵綁定</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增夜視與覆蓋層（濾鏡）的組合按鍵綁定</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增裝備夜視鏡時顯示色彩覆蓋層的按鍵綁定</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 按下時會在快捷欄上方顯示 true 或 false</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 預設為 false</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 骷髏現在有 1% 機率生成時裝備夜視鏡</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 裝備夜視鏡的骷髏死亡後有機率掉落該物品</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>1.1.2</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&bull; 夜視鏡現在可像方塊一樣放置於地面</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 放置於地面的夜視鏡為實體，允許任意角度旋轉&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 放置夜視鏡時的旋轉方向取決於玩家面向的方向</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 新增旋轉介面以設定夜視鏡的特定旋轉角度</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 右鍵點擊已放置的夜視鏡即可開啟旋轉介面</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 新增介面以便在裝備夜視鏡時切換夜視與覆蓋層（濾鏡）功能</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 手持任意夜視鏡於主手並蹲下右鍵即可開啟介面</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 移除裝備夜視鏡時顯示覆蓋層（濾鏡）的按鍵綁定</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;-「裝備時套用濾鏡」開關現已移至介面中</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 壓縮 logo.png 並刪除重複檔案，使模組檔案大小不再超過 2.5MB</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 夜視鏡現在可放置於盔甲架上（測試版）</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 避免點擊盔甲架的頭部支架</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 若點擊盔甲架頭部支架，夜視鏡會顯示在盔甲架上，但仍保留在玩家手中</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 欲正確裝備，請點擊盔甲架的身體部位</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&bull; 骷髏掉落夜視鏡的機率改為 33%（不受抢夺附魔影響）</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
